# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Packer
packer/packer-manifest.json
packer_cache/

# Secrets that must never be committed
*.pem
*.key
.env

# Lock files belong to root configurations (live/*), not reusable modules
modules/**/.terraform.lock.hcl
